🧠 FINAL TAKEAWAY (this is the “aha”)

Each directory pushes its own iterator

Child iterators take priority

Parent iterators are paused, not lost

Traversal is DFS, pre-order

🎯 One-line mental model

“Push child iterators → fully exhaust them → pop → resume parent.”

